1
00:00:00,350 --> 00:00:05,053
Oh no, four stars are lost! Let's find the first one: big back teeth, outside!

2
00:00:05,200 --> 00:00:07,158
A twinkle! Now the front teeth.

3
00:00:10,200 --> 00:00:13,368
Now the back side, inside, by the roof of your mouth!

4
00:00:15,200 --> 00:00:17,600
Inside the front teeth, up and down!

5
00:00:20,200 --> 00:00:22,426
Now the chewing tops, scrub, scrub!

6
00:00:25,250 --> 00:00:26,364
Here it comes!

7
00:00:27,020 --> 00:00:27,854
Three!

8
00:00:28,020 --> 00:00:28,799
Two!

9
00:00:29,020 --> 00:00:29,744
One!

10
00:00:30,350 --> 00:00:34,963
One star is home! Follow the trail to the other side, back teeth, outside!

11
00:00:35,200 --> 00:00:36,932
A crack! Front teeth now.

12
00:00:40,200 --> 00:00:41,843
The back side, inside!

13
00:00:45,200 --> 00:00:47,600
Inside the front teeth, up and down!

14
00:00:50,200 --> 00:00:51,988
Chewing tops, scrub, scrub!

15
00:00:55,250 --> 00:00:56,692
The ice is breaking!

16
00:00:57,020 --> 00:00:57,854
Three!

17
00:00:58,020 --> 00:00:58,799
Two!

18
00:00:59,020 --> 00:00:59,744
One!

19
00:01:00,350 --> 00:01:04,851
Two stars! The moon has a secret... Bottom teeth, back teeth, outside.

20
00:01:05,200 --> 00:01:07,679
The moon is waking up! Front teeth now.

21
00:01:10,200 --> 00:01:12,428
The back side, inside, by your tongue!

22
00:01:15,200 --> 00:01:17,600
Inside the front teeth, up and down!

23
00:01:20,200 --> 00:01:23,213
A petal opens! Chewing tops, scrub, scrub!

24
00:01:25,250 --> 00:01:26,753
The flower is opening!

25
00:01:27,020 --> 00:01:27,854
Three!

26
00:01:28,020 --> 00:01:28,799
Two!

27
00:01:29,020 --> 00:01:29,744
One!

28
00:01:30,350 --> 00:01:33,843
Just one more star! The other side, back teeth, outside!

29
00:01:35,200 --> 00:01:37,356
A piece of light! Front teeth now.

30
00:01:40,200 --> 00:01:41,843
The back side, inside!

31
00:01:45,200 --> 00:01:47,600
Inside the front teeth, up and down!

32
00:01:50,200 --> 00:01:52,035
Last part, the chewing tops!

33
00:01:55,250 --> 00:01:56,958
The sky is almost ready!

34
00:01:57,020 --> 00:01:57,854
Three!

35
00:01:58,020 --> 00:01:58,799
Two!

36
00:01:59,020 --> 00:01:59,744
One!

37
00:02:00,300 --> 00:02:01,203
Wonderful!

38
00:02:01,193 --> 00:02:05,000
You helped Lumi bring every star home. Your smile is shining bright!
